WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.014 --> 00:00:04.456
Workflows: automations that check numbers, notify people, ask agents and wait for approval.

2
00:00:04.456 --> 00:00:07.739
Each workflow lists when it starts and the steps it runs, such as overdue invoices, notify finance, send reminders.

3
00:00:07.739 --> 00:00:15.576
Agent work that changes data is held for a person to review before anything runs.

4
00:00:15.576 --> 00:00:19.520
The run shows what the agent proposes. Nothing has been executed until an authorised person approves or rejects.
